# API Standards

## Internal Dashboard (FastAPI)

- Default: `http://127.0.0.1:8080`
- JSON responses; HTML only for `/`

### Endpoint Patterns

| Method | Pattern | Example |
|--------|---------|---------|
| GET | `/api/<resource>` | `/api/positions`, `/api/status` |
| GET | `/api/<resource>/{id}` | `/api/candles/{symbol}`, `/api/regime/{symbol}` |
| POST | `/api/<resource>/<action>` | `/api/engine/start`, `/api/universe/rescan` |
| POST | `/api/<resource>` | `/api/pairs`, `/api/mode` |
| DELETE | `/api/<resource>/{id}` | `/api/pairs/{symbol}` |

### Key Endpoints

- `/api/engine/start`, `/api/engine/stop` — engine control
- `/api/heartbeat` — engine state/uptime
- `/api/mode` — get/set demo vs live
- `/api/universe`, `/api/universe/rescan` — universe management
- `/api/positions`, `/api/trades`, `/api/status` — portfolio
- `/api/signals`, `/api/regime/{symbol}` — strategy output

### Error Responses

```json
{"error": "message"}
```

Use appropriate HTTP status: 400 (bad request), 404 (not found), 500 (server error).

## Delta Exchange REST

Client: `src/execution/exchange.py`

### Base URLs

| Env | REST | WebSocket |
|-----|------|-----------|
| Prod | `https://api.india.delta.exchange` | `wss://socket.india.delta.exchange` |
| Testnet | `https://cdn-ind.testnet.deltaex.org` | `wss://socket-ind.testnet.deltaex.org` |

### Endpoints Used

- `GET /v2/products`, `GET /v2/tickers/{symbol}`
- `GET /v2/history/candles`
- `GET /v2/wallet/balances`, `GET /v2/positions`, `GET /v2/positions/margined`
- `POST /v2/orders`, `GET /v2/orders/{id}`, `DELETE /v2/orders/{id}`
- `GET /v2/orders/client_order_id/{id}` — idempotency lookup
- `POST /v2/orders/bracket` — SL/TP

### Conventions

- HMAC signing on all authenticated requests
- Rate-limit aware; backoff on 429
- `client_order_id` (UUID hex) for idempotent placement

## WebSocket

- Reconnect on drop
- Heartbeat pings
- Candle/ticker subscriptions per symbol
